# Goblin

## Lore

Goblins, with Orcs, are the commonest of the Palladium World''s "monster races", and they turn up on other worlds too - ancient Earth among them - carried there as the underlings of dragons, sorcerers and supernatural beings or slipping through Rifts on the ley lines. They breed like rats and could dominate any ecology they reach if laziness, infighting and malice did not hold them back. They are distant cousins of the Faerie Folk, though only the Cobbler keeps any Faerie magic.

Goblin tribes live in shabby huts or underground warrens, ruled by a Warrior Chief or Goblin King with a War Chief and a Shaman, Witch or Priest of Darkness beneath him; a coup reorders the whole tribe. Orcs, Ogres and Hob-Goblins often live among them.

On Rifts Earth only a thousand or so are known in North America, mostly around Calgary and the Detroit-Windsor Rift, but tens of thousands plague Europe, especially the east. Most people take a Goblin for a vile D-Bee; those in the know call it an evil Faerie.

**Alignment:** Any, but leans toward Anarchist (30%), Miscreant (40%) and Diabolic (20%).

**Size:** Three feet plus 2D6 inches. **Weight:** 60 to 100 pounds.

**Average Life Span:** 80 years.

## GM Notes

Goblins are mean-spirited, vindictive and cruel, operate on the rule that the strong prey on the weak, and make willing henchmen for any evil power that promises them a chance to hurt the larger, handsomer races. They love Vibro-Blades, energy weapons and instruments of torture. Traditional enemies are humans, Elves, Dwarves, Gnomes and anything large and beautiful; allies are Orcs, Hob-Goblins, Trolls and the Wolfen, who hope to unite Goblins and Orcs against humankind.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'rifts-goblin');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'rifts-goblin';

